Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.5 41/75] pwm: renesas-tpu: Fix late Runtime PM enablement
Date:   Sat, 18 Apr 2020 10:08:36 -0400
Message-Id: <20200418140910.8280-41-sashal@kernel.org>
